 MetaWINDOW SUPPORTED GRAPHICS CARDS
          September 1993

The following is a partial list of the graphics
cards supported by MetaWINDOW.  Our policy is
support all available cards.  If your card is not
on the list, call us.  Chances are we either
support it, or are working on supporting it.

'+' indicates hardware accelerated mode supported
    with MetACCEL.

'*' indicates 65536 "high-color" mode supported
    with MetHICOLOR.

- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -

